      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Expected inventory: 3 control-plane + 6 worker nodes. Counts deduplicate kube-state-metrics replicas. Scrape health is shown separately from workload health. Journals below are host journals in Loki, not Kubernetes pod logs. Missing series are not filled with healthy zeros."
